# Shared calc.fdf template for the whole HER workflow. Left as non-polarized
# and with MD.VariableCell true on purpose: stb-her's own config_extra.fdf
# unconditionally overrides BOTH (fixed cell, Spin polarized -- Section 3.2
# of the README) -- this template proves those overrides actually win over
# whatever the template itself says, the same "%include-d ahead of your own
# settings, first-occurrence-wins" mechanism every config_extra.fdf-based
# tool in this suite uses.
SystemLabel siesta
%include structure.fdf

PAO.BasisType split
PAO.BasisSize DZP
kgrid.MonkhorstPack [4 4 1]
Mesh.CutOff 200 Ry
XC.functional GGA
XC.authors PBE
Spin non-polarized

MD.TypeOfRun CG
MD.VariableCell true
MD.MaxForceTol 0.01 eV/Ang
MD.Steps 150
